title: "AI Intelligent Student Learning Companion: A Full-Stack Academic Copilot Powered by Google Gemini and ChromaDB RAG"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
url: "https://github.com/NagarajuMudhiraj/AI-Intelligent-Student-Learning-Companion"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NagarajuMudhiraj/AI-Intelligent-Student-Learning-Companion"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, full-stack AI-driven student learning assistant that ingests multi-format
  academic documents (PDF, DOCX, PPTX, TXT) and generates grounded RAG conversations,
  adaptive Bloom's taxonomy quizzes, 3D study flashcards, dynamic revision timetables,
  and career skill recommendations using Google Gemini, FastAPI, and React 19.
keywords:
  - "retrieval-augmented-generation"
